(104549: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20items%20of%20a%20JavaScript%20module%20translated%20into%20Rust%20in%20the%20order%20of%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20names%20they%20use%2C%20so%20an%20item%20may%20call%20and%20read%20the%20module%27s%20other%20items%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20the%20items%20it%20imports.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60translateBound%60%2C%20%60scanItem%60%20and%20%60declaredSignatures%60%20in%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BBTreeMap%2C%20HashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0A%0Amod%20deferred_scope%3B%0Amod%20dependency_rules%3B%0Amod%20owned_recursive_emission%3B%0Amod%20recursive_groups%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3A%7BContext%2C%20Group%2C%20GroupKind%2C%20Translated%2C%20translate_group%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Adecorators%3A%3ADecoratorSet%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3ALanguage%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7BDecl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Node%2C%20Program%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Ajavascript%3A%3AModuleContext%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Alexer%3A%3A%7BToken%2C%20TokenKind%2C%20tokenize%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3A%7BExternal%2C%20ExternalParam%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Atypes%3A%3AType%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20A%20named%20import%20an%20item%20makes%3A%20its%20specifier%20and%20the%20imported%20and%20bound%20names.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%29%5D%0Astruct%20ImportScan%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20specifier%3A%20String%2C%0A%20%20%20%20names%3A%20Vec%3C%28String%2C%20String%29%3E%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20What%20a%20JavaScript%20item%20declares%20and%20names%2C%20read%20from%20its%20tokens.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%29%5D%0Apub%28super%29%20struct%20Scan%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20declares%3A%20Option%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20pub%28super%29%20exported%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20is_async%3A%20bool%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Ordinary%20is%20the%20actual%20named%20declaration%20branc